  "classification_model": "hybrid-hierarchical-metadata",
  "rules": [
    "One canonical movie record per film; folders are logical classifications, not duplicate media copies.",
    "Original audio language is distinct from dubbed audio languages.",
    "Film industry, production country, language and genre are independent dimensions.",
    "A movie may belong to multiple virtual folders through metadata relationships.",
    "Folder IDs are stable; display names may change without changing identity.",
    "Unknown metadata remains unknown and must not be inferred."
